#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:2
msgid "How to manage custom domains"
msgstr "如何管理自定义域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:4
msgid ""
"This guide describes how to host your documentation using your own domain "
"name, such as ``docs.example.com``."
msgstr "本指南讲解如何使用自有域名（如 ``docs.example.com`` ）托管文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:7
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "目录"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:10
msgid "Adding a custom domain"
msgstr "添加自定义域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:12
msgid "To set up your :doc:`custom domain </custom-domains>`, follow these steps:"
msgstr "要设置 :doc:`自定义域名 </custom-domains>` ，按以下步骤操作："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:14
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:62
msgid "Go to your project's :menuselection:`Settings --> Domains`."
msgstr "前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Domains` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:15
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:19
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`Add domain`."
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`Add domain` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:16
msgid ""
"Enter the domain where you want to serve the documentation from (e.g. "
"``docs.example.com``)."
msgstr "输入你希望提供文档服务的域名（如 ``docs.example.com`` ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:17
msgid ""
"Mark the :guilabel:`Canonical` option if you want to use this domain as your"
" :doc:`canonical domain </canonical-urls>`."
msgstr "若想将该域名用作 :doc:`规范域名 </canonical-urls>` ，请勾选 :guilabel:`Canonical` 选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:20
msgid ""
"At the top of the next page you'll find the value of the DNS record that you"
" need to point your domain to. For |org_brand| this is ``readthedocs.io``, "
"and for :doc:`/commercial/index` the record is in the form of "
"``<hash>.domains.readthedocs.com``. If you are using Cloudflare, make sure "
"to disable the proxy status (orange cloud) for the CNAME record."
msgstr ""
"下一页顶部会显示你需要将域名指向的 DNS 记录值。对于 |org_brand| 是 ``readthedocs.io`` ，对于 "
":doc:`/commercial/index` 则形如 ``<hash>.domains.readthedocs.com`` 。若你使用 "
"Cloudflare，请确保为 CNAME 记录关闭代理状态（橙色云朵）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:27
msgid ""
"For a subdomain like ``docs.example.com`` add a CNAME record, and for a root"
" domain like ``example.com`` use an ANAME or ALIAS record."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``docs.example.com`` 这样的子域名添加 CNAME 记录；对于 ``example.com`` 这样的根域名使用 ANAME "
"或 ALIAS 记录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:32
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:75
msgid ""
"If you delete a domain, make sure to also remove the DNS records for that "
"domain. Otherwise, another user may add the same domain to their project and"
" serve that content from your domain (domain hijacking)."
msgstr "若删除域名，请务必同时移除该域名的 DNS 记录。否则其他用户可能把同一域名添加到他们的项目，并从你的域名提供该内容（域名劫持）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:35
msgid ""
"SSL certificates are automatically provisioned for your domain once the DNS "
"record (CNAME or ANAME/ALIAS) is pointed to Read the Docs, no extra action "
"or certificate request is needed. Certificates are managed by `Cloudflare "
"<https://www.cloudflare.com/>`_ and are typically issued within a few "
"minutes, but may take up to one hour. See `SSL certificate issue delays`_ "
"for more troubleshooting options."
msgstr ""
"DNS 记录（CNAME 或 ANAME/ALIAS）指向 Read the Docs 后，你的域名的 SSL "
"证书会自动配置，无需额外操作或申请证书。证书由 `Cloudflare <https://www.cloudflare.com/>`_ "
"管理，通常几分钟内签发，但最长可能需要一小时。更多排查选项见 `SSL certificate issue delays`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:43
msgid ""
"To see if your DNS change has propagated, you can use a tool like ``dig`` to"
" inspect your domain from your command line. As an example, our blog's DNS "
"record looks like this:"
msgstr "要查看 DNS 变更是否已生效，可用 ``dig`` 等工具从命令行检查你的域名。例如，我们博客的 DNS 记录如下："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:53
msgid ""
"We don't support pointing subdomains or root domains to a project using A "
"records. DNS A records require a static IP address and our IPs may change "
"without notice."
msgstr "我们不支持用 A 记录将子域名或根域名指向项目。DNS A 记录需要静态 IP 地址，而我们的 IP 可能随时变更。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:58
msgid "Removing a custom domain"
msgstr "移除自定义域名"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:60
msgid "To remove a custom domain:"
msgstr "要移除自定义域名："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:63
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`Remove domain` button next to the domain."
msgstr "点击该域名旁的 :guilabel:`Remove domain` 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:64
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Remove domain` in the confirmation dialog."
msgstr "在确认对话框中点击 :guilabel:`Remove domain` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:65
msgid "Remove the DNS record for the domain from your DNS provider."
msgstr "从你的 DNS 服务商移除该域名的 DNS 记录。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:69
msgid ""
"Once a domain is removed, your previous documentation domain is no longer "
"served by Read the Docs, and any request for it will return a 404 Not Found!"
msgstr "域名移除后，Read the Docs 不再提供你此前文档域名的服务，对它的任何请求都将返回 404 Not Found！"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:79
msgid "Strict Transport Security (HSTS) and other custom headers"
msgstr "严格传输安全（HSTS）与其他自定义标头"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:81
msgid ""
"By default, we do not return a `Strict Transport Security header`_ (HSTS) "
"for user custom domains. This is a conscious decision as it can be "
"misconfigured in a not easily reversible way. For both |org_brand| and "
"|com_brand|, HSTS and other custom headers can be set upon request."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，我们不会为用户自定义域名返回 `Strict Transport Security header`_ "
"（HSTS）。这是一个经过深思的决定，因为它可能被错误配置且不易撤销。对于 |org_brand| 和 |com_brand|，均可按需设置 HSTS "
"和其他自定义标头。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:85
msgid ""
"We always return the HSTS header with a max-age of at least one year for our"
" own domains including ``*.readthedocs.io``, ``*.readthedocs-hosted.com``, "
"``readthedocs.org`` and ``readthedocs.com``."
msgstr ""
"对我们自己的域名（包括 ``*.readthedocs.io`` 、``*.readthedocs-hosted.com`` "
"、``readthedocs.org`` 和 ``readthedocs.com`` ），始终返回 max-age 至少一年的 HSTS 标头。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:90
msgid ""
"Please contact :doc:`/support` if you want to add a custom header to your "
"domain."
msgstr "若你想为域名添加自定义标头，请联系 :doc:`/support` 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:95
msgid "Multiple documentation sites as sub-folders of a domain"
msgstr "将多个文档站点作为域名的子目录"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:97
msgid ""
"You may host multiple documentation repositories as **sub-folders of a "
"single domain**. For example, ``docs.example.org/projects/repo1`` and "
"``docs.example.org/projects/repo2``. This is `a way to boost the SEO of your"
" website <https://moz.com/blog/subdomains-vs-subfolders-rel-canonical-vs-301"
"-how-to-structure-links-optimally-for-seo-whiteboard-friday>`_."
msgstr ""
"你可以将多个文档仓库作为**单个域名的子目录** 来托管。例如 ``docs.example.org/projects/repo1`` 和 "
"``docs.example.org/projects/repo2`` 。这是 `提升网站 SEO 的一种方式 "
"<https://moz.com/blog/subdomains-vs-subfolders-rel-canonical-vs-301-how-to-"
"structure-links-optimally-for-seo-whiteboard-friday>`_ 。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:103
msgid ":doc:`/subprojects`"
msgstr ":doc:`/subprojects`"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:104
msgid ""
"Further information about hosting multiple documentation repositories, using"
" the :term:`subproject` feature."
msgstr "关于使用 :term:`subproject` 功能托管多个文档仓库的更多信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:108
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:111
msgid "\"Error 1014: CNAME Cross-User Banned\" when using Cloudflare"
msgstr "使用 Cloudflare 时出现\"Error 1014: CNAME Cross-User Banned\""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:113
msgid ""
"Read the Docs uses Cloudflare to manage SSL certificates for custom domains,"
" CDN caching, and other features that require the domain to be completely "
"managed by our Cloudflare account."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 使用 Cloudflare 管理自定义域名的 SSL 证书、CDN 缓存，以及其他要求域名完全由我们的 Cloudflare"
" 账户管理的功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:116
msgid ""
"If you see an \"Error 1014: CNAME Cross-User Banned\" message, it means that"
" the domain is already managed by another Cloudflare account. To fix this, "
"you need to:"
msgstr ""
"若看到\"Error 1014: CNAME Cross-User Banned\"消息，说明该域名已由另一个 Cloudflare "
"账户管理。要解决此问题，你需要："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:120
msgid "Log in your Cloudflare account (https://www.cloudflare.com/)."
msgstr "登录你的 Cloudflare 账户（https://www.cloudflare.com/）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:121
msgid "Select your domain."
msgstr "选择你的域名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:122
msgid "Click on \"DNS\"."
msgstr "点击\"DNS\"。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:123
msgid "Find your CNAME record and click on \"Edit\"."
msgstr "找到你的 CNAME 记录并点击\"Edit\"。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:124
msgid "Uncheck the \"Proxy status\" (orange cloud) option."
msgstr "取消勾选\"Proxy status\"（橙色云朵）选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:125
msgid "Leave everything else unchanged."
msgstr "其余设置保持不变。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:126
msgid "Click on save."
msgstr "点击保存。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:129
msgid "SSL certificate issue delays"
msgstr "SSL 证书签发延迟"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:131
msgid ""
"The status of your domain validation and certificate can always be seen on "
"the details page for your domain. Go to your project's "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Domains` and click on your domain."
msgstr "你的域名验证和证书状态始终可在域名的详情页查看。前往项目的 :menuselection:`Settings --> Domains` 并点击你的域名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:134
msgid ""
"Domains are usually validated and a certificate issued within minutes. "
"However, if you setup the domain in Read the Docs without provisioning the "
"necessary DNS changes and then update DNS hours or days later, this can "
"cause a delay in validating because there is an exponential back-off in "
"validation."
msgstr ""
"域名通常几分钟内即可验证并签发证书。但若你在 Read the Docs 中设置域名时未做必要的 DNS 变更，而是在数小时或数天后才更新 "
"DNS，由于验证采用指数退避，验证会被延迟。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:141
msgid ""
"Loading the domain details in the Read the Docs dashboard and saving the "
"domain again will force a revalidation."
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 仪表盘中加载域名详情并再次保存该域名，可强制重新验证。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:144
msgid "Disallowed DNS configurations"
msgstr "不允许的 DNS 配置"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:146
msgid ""
"In order to prevent some common cases of domain hijacking, we disallow some "
"DNS configurations:"
msgstr "为防止一些常见的域名劫持情形，我们不允许以下 DNS 配置："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:148
msgid ""
"CNAME records pointing to another CNAME record (``doc.example.com -> "
"docs.example.com -> readthedocs.io``)."
msgstr ""
"CNAME 记录指向另一个 CNAME 记录（``doc.example.com -> docs.example.com -> "
"readthedocs.io`` ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:150
msgid ""
"CNAME records pointing to the APEX domain (``www.example.com -> example.com "
"-> readthedocs.io``)."
msgstr "CNAME 记录指向 APEX 域（``www.example.com -> example.com -> readthedocs.io`` ）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:153
msgid ""
"This prevents attackers from taking over unused domains with CNAME records "
"pointing to domains that are on Read the Docs."
msgstr "这可防止攻击者通过指向 Read the Docs 域名的 CNAME 记录劫持未使用的域名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:157
msgid ""
"Users shouldn't rely on these restrictions to prevent domain hijacking. We "
"recommend regularly reviewing your DNS records, removing any that are no "
"longer needed or that don't exist on Read the Docs, or registering all valid"
" domains in your project."
msgstr ""
"用户不应依赖这些限制来防止域名劫持。我们建议定期检查 DNS 记录，移除不再需要或不在 Read the Docs "
"上存在的记录，或在项目中注册所有有效域名。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:163
msgid "The validation process period has ended"
msgstr "验证流程期限已结束"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:165
msgid ""
"After you add a new custom domain, you have 30 days to complete the "
"configuration. Once that period has ended, we will stop trying to validate "
"your domain. If you still want to complete the configuration, go to your "
"domain and click on :guilabel:`Save` to restart the process."
msgstr ""
"添加新自定义域名后，你有 30 天时间完成配置。该期限结束后，我们将停止尝试验证你的域名。若仍想完成配置，请前往该域名并点击 "
":guilabel:`Save` 以重启流程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:171
msgid "Migrating from GitBook"
msgstr "从 GitBook 迁移"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/guides/custom-domains.rst:173
msgid ""
"If your custom domain was previously used in GitBook, contact GitBook "
"support (via live chat in their website) to remove the domain name from "
"their DNS Zone in order for your domain name to work with Read the Docs, "
"otherwise it will always redirect to GitBook."
msgstr ""
"若你的自定义域名此前用于 GitBook，请联系 GitBook 支持（通过其网站在线聊天）从他们的 DNS Zone 中移除该域名，你的域名才能配合 "
"Read the Docs 工作，否则将始终重定向到 GitBook。"

